Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.90,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}After merging, check the commander again and expand the complete regiment list.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.89,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}合军后重新看统帅，也重新展开完整兵团。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.89,0:00:10.36,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}一条一人满员一人的记录，首先只是这条记录的实际人数。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.90,0:00:07.69,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}An entry showing one current troop out of one
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.69,0:00:10.61,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}maximum first tells us only that entry's actual
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.36,0:00:15.29,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}它可能没有普通兵槽数据；只凭这个数字，还不能叫
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.61,0:00:10.98,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}count.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.98,0:00:13.41,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}It may have no ordinary troop-slot data.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.41,0:00:16.57,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}That number alone cannot identify it as a knight or
